(7761673, 1285811, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nowhere_Man:</b></div><hr/><i> I could swear the guitarist is more of a "picker" than a strummer here, but either way, you have conveyed sound here.  Congrats on the ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> Actually, you''re right,  he was mostly picking when he played the guitar, and strumming when he sang (both very well). But "picking" as a title didn''t look very good, LOL</td>', 'Originally posted by Nowhere_Man: I could swear the guitarist is more of a "picker" than a strummer here, but either way, you have conveyed sound here.  Congrats on the ribbon!  Actually, you''re right,  he was mostly picking when he played the guitar, and strumming when he sang (both very well). But "picking" as a title didn''t look very good, LOL', '2024-01-04 13:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
